  "prefLabel": "Tre 302.05 Examination",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Tre 302.05 “Examination” means the process of requesting, receiving, analyzing and otherwise reviewing the records of any holder or person for the purpose of determining compliance with RSA 471-C.\n\nSource. #7435, eff 1-25-01, EXPIRED: 1-25-09\n\nNew. #9465, INTERIM, eff 4-25-09, EXPIRED: 10-22-09",
